{
 "id": "seg5b",
 "title": "今天能做什么",
 "pill": 5,
 "total": 65.02,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg5b-00",
   "text": "最后，每个人今天就能做一件事。",
   "spoken": "最后，每个人今天就能做一件事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg5b-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 4.237
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-01",
   "text": "写合约的人，找到第一个把控制权交出去的位置，问一句：那一刻，哪些状态还没更新？",
   "spoken": "写合约的人，找到第一个把控制权交出去的位置，问一句：那一刻，哪些状态还没更新？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg5b-01.wav",
   "start": 4.62,
   "dur": 8.32,
   "speechStart": 4.62,
   "speechEnd": 12.735
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-02",
   "text": "审计的人，查一下编译器版本有没有已知的锁 bug，再查部署链上转原生币，会不会触发 fallback。",
   "spoken": "审计的人，查一下编译器版本有没有已知的锁 bug，再查部署链上转原生币，会不会触发 fallback。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg5b-02.wav",
   "start": 13.44,
   "dur": 8.48,
   "speechStart": 13.44,
   "speechEnd": 21.668
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-03",
   "text": "普通用户，存款前看协议有没有审计报告，范围是否覆盖你要用的合约。",
   "spoken": "普通用户，存款前看协议有没有审计报告，范围是否覆盖你要用的合约。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg5b-03.wav",
   "start": 22.14,
   "dur": 6.56,
   "speechStart": 22.14,
   "speechEnd": 28.465
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-04",
   "text": "没有审计的新金库，只放能承受损失的金额。",
   "spoken": "没有审计的新金库，只放能承受损失的金额。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg5b-04.wav",
   "start": 28.92,
   "dur": 4.24,
   "speechStart": 29.016,
   "speechEnd": 32.95
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-05",
   "text": "回到开头的问题。只调用一次取款，为什么能取走全部 10 个 ETH？",
   "spoken": "回到开头的问题。只掉用一次取款，为什么能取走全部 10 个 ETH？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg5b-05.wav",
   "start": 33.38,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "speechStart": 33.484,
   "speechEnd": 39.116
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-06",
   "text": "因为银行先给钱、后记账。每一层嵌套调用，读到的都是同一个旧余额。",
   "spoken": "因为银航先给钱、后记账。每一层嵌套掉用，读到的都是同一个旧余额。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg5b-06.wav",
   "start": 39.88,
   "dur": 7.04,
   "speechStart": 39.88,
   "speechEnd": 46.727
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-07",
   "text": "这个答案的前提，是收款方能执行代码，而状态在交出控制权之前还没更新。",
   "spoken": "这个答案的前提，是收款方能执行代码，而状态在交出控制权之前还没更新。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg5b-07.wav",
   "start": 47.14,
   "dur": 6.56,
   "speechStart": 47.237,
   "speechEnd": 53.441
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-08",
   "text": "把顺序写对，第二层读到的就是 0。",
   "spoken": "把顺序写对，第二层读到的就是 0。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg5b-08.wav",
   "start": 53.92,
   "dur": 3.28,
   "speechStart": 54.014,
   "speechEnd": 57.036
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-09",
   "text": "下一集讲访问控制与权限：谁有权按这个按钮。",
